{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e091d6006945d27fc63e","chatId":"8e1bba62ceb0495a84222dc43a0ed1b5","sessionId":null,"userId":51593,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":881,"promptTokens":1511,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:13"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01098410446844004,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e091d6006945d27fc63d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367633427,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e091d6006945d27fc63d","chatId":"8e1bba62ceb0495a84222dc43a0ed1b5","sessionId":null,"userId":51593,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n李婷的两岁儿子小明在玩耍时无意中发现了她的首饰，将它当作玩具进行游戏，无意间将首饰磕坏了。小明的姐姐小华看到了这一切，但她觉得母亲最近的管教严格，决定不告诉母亲。当李婷发现首饰的损坏后，开始询问孩子们，才发现是小明磕坏了。\n\n[问题]\n小华的行为可能是出于什么样的意图？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小华不希望弟弟因为磕坏首饰而感到愧疚，所以没有告诉母亲。\nB. 小华可能因为认为弟弟不知道首饰的意义，所以没有告诉母亲的必要。\nC. 小华不想要母亲因为首饰损坏而心情不好，所以没有告诉母亲。\nD. 小华可能因为不希望弟弟受母亲责骂，所以没有告诉母亲。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01098410446844004,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e091d6006945d27fc63e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367633425,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"af03b70bd02c40c0b20b3b58723094dc"}